{
  "summary": "In LibreOffice Impress, a slide background encompasses all colors and graphic effects behind the slide content. Through the Slide Master feature, accessible from the View menu, modifications and formatting preferences can be applied uniformly across an entire presentation. The Master View toolbar allows users to create, delete, and rename master pages. Slide backgrounds can be customized using the Page Setup dialog box under the Format menu or via the right-click context menu, where options such as blank bitmaps or solid colors like Blue 8 can be selected. For optimal readability, text colors should contrast sharply with the background, and they can be modified through the Character dialog box on the Font Effects tab. Furthermore, design elements and basic geometric shapes, such as rectangles, circles, and triangles, can be inserted using the Basic Shapes toolbar at the bottom of the screen. When a shape is drawn, eight control points appear around it, allowing users to resize and adjust the object easily.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact": "A slide background refers to all colors and effects applied behind the content of the slide.",
      "evidence": "background slide पर लागू किये गये सभी रंगों और प्रभावों को उद्घृत करता है जो विषयवस्तु के पीछे मौजूद हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Any alteration made to the master slide applies to every slide in the presentation.",
      "evidence": "master slide पर किया गया कोई भी परिवर्तन प्रस्तुति के सभी slides के लिए लागू होता है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The Slide Master view is opened by navigating to View, selecting Master, and clicking Slide Master from the main menu.",
      "evidence": "main menu से view पर click करें master चुनें और slide master पर click करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The master view toolbar can be used to create, delete, and rename master pages.",
      "evidence": "master view toolbar भी दिखाई देंता है आप इसका उपयोग master pages तैयार डिलीट और नाम परिवर्तन करने के लिए कर सकते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "A white background can be applied by choosing the blank option under bitmap fill in the Page Setup dialog box.",
      "evidence": "background टैब पर click करें fill dropdown menu से bitmap option चुनें options की सूची से blank चुनें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The text color can be set to black from the Font Effects tab within the Character dialog box.",
      "evidence": "character dialog box से font effects टैब पर click करें font color dropdown से black चुनें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "A light blue color can be applied to a slide by selecting Blue 8 from the color fill dropdown menu in Page Setup.",
      "evidence": "fill dropdown menu से color option चुनें blue 8 चुनें और ok पर click करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The basic shapes toolbar at the bottom of the screen allows users to draw various basic shapes.",
      "evidence": "अपनी screen के नीचे basic shapes toolbar को देखें आप इसका उपयोग विभिन्न बुनियादी आकार बनाने के लिए कर सकते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "When drawing a rectangle, the cursor displays a plus sign accompanied by a capital letter I.",
      "evidence": "आप capital i के साथ plus sign देखेंगे"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The control points that appear on a selected object are eight small blue squares used to resize it.",
      "evidence": "handles या control प्वॉइन्ट्स छोटे नीले squares हैं जो चुनित object के स्लाइड्स पर दिखाई दे रहे हैं"
    }
  ]
}
